            </div>

            <div class="oz-value-card">
                <div class="oz-feat-card-icon oz-icon-amber">
                    <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="oz-value-card-title">Learning &amp; Growth Budget</h3>
                <p class="oz-value-card-desc">Annual personal training budget, professional certifications, language lessons, and unlimited access to learning platforms.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="oz-value-card">
                <div class="oz-feat-card-icon oz-icon-violet">
                    <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="oz-value-card-title">Generous Paid Leave</h3>
                <p class="oz-value-card-desc">28+ days of paid annual vacation plus regional public holidays, volunteer charity days, and parental leave packages.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="oz-value-card">
                <div class="oz-feat-card-icon oz-icon-emerald">
                    <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="oz-value-card-title">Home Office Stipend</h3>
                <p class="oz-value-card-desc">Top-tier laptop equipment (MacBook Pro or Dell XPS), 4K monitors, and ergonomic home workstation reimbursement.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
